WEBVTT

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.111
When teachers are burned out,

00:21:31.135 --> 00:21:35.679
their students show elevated cortisol,
a classic stress response.

00:21:36.135 --> 00:21:38.626
More and more organizations
are dealing with burnout

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.003
by offering mindfulness training.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.776
It might help with some of the symptoms,

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.476
but it doesn't get to the root
of the problem.

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:48.846
If more than one person is facing burnout,

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.213
deep breathing
is a Band-Aid, not a repair.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.766
You need to change
the structure of the job,

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.243
or the culture of the organization.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.326
If you want to tackle burnout at scale,